{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1029","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. Many Equal Substrings"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given a string $$$t$$$ consisting of $$$n$$$ lowercase Latin letters and an integer number $$$k$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Let's define a substring of some string $$$s$$$ with indices from $$$l$$$ to $$$r$$$ as $$$s[l \\dots r]$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Your task is to construct such string $$$s$$$ of minimum possible length that there are exactly $$$k$$$ positions $$$i$$$ such that $$$s[i \\dots i + n - 1] = t$$$. In other words, your task is to construct such string $$$s$$$ of minimum possible length that there are exactly $$$k$$$ substrings of $$$s$$$ equal to $$$t$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that the answer is always unique."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of the input contains two integers $$$n$$$ and $$$k$$$ ($$$1 \\le n, k \\le 50$$$) — the length of the string $$$t$$$ and the number of substrings."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line of the input contains the string $$$t$$$ consisting of exactly $$$n$$$ lowercase Latin letters."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print such string $$$s$$$ of minimum possible length that there are exactly $$$k$$$ substrings of $$$s$$$ equal to $$$t$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that the answer is always unique."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3 4\naba\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"ababababa\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3 2\ncat\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"catcat\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"A","problemCode":"1029A","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1029/problem/A"}